                            <comment id="15848144" author="sboikov" created="Wed, 1 Feb 2017 08:59:37 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Reviewed changes, my comments:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;it does not compile with jdk7, please switch to jdk7&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&apos;while (rmvQueue.peekFirst().expireTime() &amp;lt; U.currentTimeMillis())&apos; - you need check result of &apos;peekFirst()&apos; for null&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;do not schedule cleanup task per-partition, it should be single task per node&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;error in &apos;onDeferredDelete&apos;, now if size &amp;gt; limit you remove all itmes from queue, actually you need pollFirst while size &amp;gt; limit&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;queue.peekFirst.expireTime &amp;gt; &apos;current time&apos; is necessary in &apos;onDeferredDelete&apos; since there can be too many expired entries and cleanup task will not be able to do cleanup fast enough&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;please follow coding conventions (remove unused imports, add javadoc for all methods, fields, &apos;Override&apos; must be on the same line with method)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Thnaks&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
